+/*
+ * Panel: CSOT PPA957DB1, NT36523 TDDI, dual-DSI C-PHY 3-lane video mode,
+ * 1600x2560@120, no DSC. The bootloader passes lcd_id 47F243 for it. The
+ * other factory option (Tianma TL109BVMS2) needs a different init sequence
+ * and is not supported by this DTS.
